From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP Folia split harden: scheduler, RTQ, hold process, entity target

Null-safe FoliaRegionScheduler/RTQ split (requeue instead of NPE/IllegalState).
Hold processTicketUpdates after add/remove. Entity portal hold drop + dragon sync + coupler link.
RegionizedWorldData entity split uses YapRegionSplit.target.
Post-applyAllPatches.
---

